    "type": "game",
    "name": "Beware the Depths",
    "steam_appid": 2796250,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/913a6576ccc1be05c7fbc349de144c83.poster.avif?t=1752601871\" width=728 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/913a6576ccc1be05c7fbc349de144c83.webm?t=1752601871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/913a6576ccc1be05c7fbc349de144c83.mp4?t=1752601871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEWARE THE DEPTHS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware the Depths is an open-world exploration and survival game for 1-8 players set in a vast procedurally-generated world. Play as an adventurer in the world of Perdita- a realm that borders reality and what lies beyond. Here you must craft, build, and battle just to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A WORLD SHROUDED IN MYSTERY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the vast lands of Perdita, where each journey offers new discoveries. From lush forests to deadly dungeons, every environment presents unique enemies to battle, resources to gather, and secrets to uncover. Sail treacherous seas in search of undiscovered lands and face the bloodthirsty monsters that call them home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/25a97f81f4f6875f4d289863d2df5895.poster.avif?t=1752601871\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/25a97f81f4f6875f4d289863d2df5895.webm?t=1752601871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/25a97f81f4f6875f4d289863d2df5895.mp4?t=1752601871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD MIGHTY STRONGHOLDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct impressive bases that provide safety from the dangers that lurk in Perdita. The detailed building system allows you to customize structures both inside and out. Progress through advanced building tiers to expand, upgrade, and defend your territory against increasingly dangerous threats.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/97baf99ac703a58b496a863fb3d168a0.poster.avif?t=1752601871\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/97baf99ac703a58b496a863fb3d168a0.webm?t=1752601871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/97baf99ac703a58b496a863fb3d168a0.mp4?t=1752601871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHALLENGE THE DEPTHS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into procedurally-generated dungeons that are familiar yet never the same. These ancient labyrinths hide valuable treasures but are home to deadly adversaries. To overstay the already hostile welcome is to invite certain death. Learn to navigate the perils, gather precious loot, and escape through mystical portals before the darkness claims you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The path to glory is paved with danger, but those who endure shall claim their place among\u00a0 The Cosmic Slayers.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/d4d7431c6c25d72d91ae8472e83bef1e.poster.avif?t=1752601871\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/d4d7431c6c25d72d91ae8472e83bef1e.webm?t=1752601871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/d4d7431c6c25d72d91ae8472e83bef1e.mp4?t=1752601871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist Beware the Depths now and join our Discord to stay updated on new features and developments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/f5bcf014a7e76431404ecdf834fc4d24.poster.avif?t=1752601871\" width=600 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/f5bcf014a7e76431404ecdf834fc4d24.webm?t=1752601871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/f5bcf014a7e76431404ecdf834fc4d24.mp4?t=1752601871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/913a6576ccc1be05c7fbc349de144c83.poster.avif?t=1752601871\" width=728 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/913a6576ccc1be05c7fbc349de144c83.webm?t=1752601871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/913a6576ccc1be05c7fbc349de144c83.mp4?t=1752601871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEWARE THE DEPTHS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware the Depths is an open-world exploration and survival game for 1-8 players set in a vast procedurally-generated world. Play as an adventurer in the world of Perdita- a realm that borders reality and what lies beyond. Here you must craft, build, and battle just to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A WORLD SHROUDED IN MYSTERY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the vast lands of Perdita, where each journey offers new discoveries. From lush forests to deadly dungeons, every environment presents unique enemies to battle, resources to gather, and secrets to uncover. Sail treacherous seas in search of undiscovered lands and face the bloodthirsty monsters that call them home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/25a97f81f4f6875f4d289863d2df5895.poster.avif?t=1752601871\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/25a97f81f4f6875f4d289863d2df5895.webm?t=1752601871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/25a97f81f4f6875f4d289863d2df5895.mp4?t=1752601871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD MIGHTY STRONGHOLDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct impressive bases that provide safety from the dangers that lurk in Perdita. The detailed building system allows you to customize structures both inside and out. Progress through advanced building tiers to expand, upgrade, and defend your territory against increasingly dangerous threats.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/97baf99ac703a58b496a863fb3d168a0.poster.avif?t=1752601871\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/97baf99ac703a58b496a863fb3d168a0.webm?t=1752601871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/97baf99ac703a58b496a863fb3d168a0.mp4?t=1752601871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHALLENGE THE DEPTHS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into procedurally-generated dungeons that are familiar yet never the same. These ancient labyrinths hide valuable treasures but are home to deadly adversaries. To overstay the already hostile welcome is to invite certain death. Learn to navigate the perils, gather precious loot, and escape through mystical portals before the darkness claims you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The path to glory is paved with danger, but those who endure shall claim their place among\u00a0 The Cosmic Slayers.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/d4d7431c6c25d72d91ae8472e83bef1e.poster.avif?t=1752601871\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/d4d7431c6c25d72d91ae8472e83bef1e.webm?t=1752601871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/d4d7431c6c25d72d91ae8472e83bef1e.mp4?t=1752601871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist Beware the Depths now and join our Discord to stay updated on new features and developments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/f5bcf014a7e76431404ecdf834fc4d24.poster.avif?t=1752601871\" width=600 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/f5bcf014a7e76431404ecdf834fc4d24.webm?t=1752601871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796250/extras/f5bcf014a7e76431404ecdf834fc4d24.mp4?t=1752601871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
